description=The first-gen Honda CRV (1997-2001, RD1). I really like this car and wanted one in Zomboid, so I made it. Opening doors, hood, side-hinged tailgate and flip-up glass. Note: the CRV is a 1997 model and Project Zomboid is set in 1993 - it is here anyway. Vehicle mesh based on "Honda CR-V 2001" by kotris666 (Sketchfab, sketchfab.com/3d-models/3565e8277a484f14b45c6888ca61a2b2), licensed CC BY 4.0 (creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/); modified: split into game parts, decimated, retextured. Surface grain from PolyHaven (CC0). Vehicle shader derived from the game's own vehicle_multiuv shader (The Indie Stone), for use in Project Zomboid only. AI (Claude, by Anthropic) was used to help make this mod. Full credits in CREDITS.txt.
